{
  "dom_id": "step-26683",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Finding an Expression for a Dimension of a Cylinder Given a Proportion",
  "problem": "Find an expression for the height $h$ of a cylinder in terms of its volume $V$ given that the ratio of the radius of the base to the height of the cylinder is $4.$",
  "worked_solution": "Using the fact that the ratio of the radius $r$ of the base to the height $h$ is $4,$ we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{r}{h} & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nOur goal is to express $h$ in terms of $V.$ Therefore, we need to isolate $r$ in the above equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{r}{h} & =4 \\\\ r & =4h\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe volume of a cylinder with radius $r$ and height $h$ is given by\n\n$$\nV = \\pi r^2 h.\n$$\n\nTherefore, substituting $r = 4h$ into the formula and solving for $h,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}V & =\\pi {r}^{2}h \\\\ V & =\\pi {(4h)}^{2}h \\\\ V & =16\\pi {h}^{3} \\\\ {h}^{3} & =\\frac{V}{16\\pi } \\\\ h & =\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{V}{16\\pi }}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-26683\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"26683\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"7217\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-26683\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-8\">Finding an Expression for a Dimension of a Cylinder Given a Proportion</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"26683\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 